      "source": "See [`src/handlers/close.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/close.rs) and [`parser/src/command/close.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/parser/src/command/close.rs).",
      "source_hash": 13285967021192778422,
      "context_hash": 5801226501789644448,
      "translation": "[`src/handlers/close.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/close.rs) 및 [`parser/src/command/close.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/parser/src/command/close.rs)를 참고하십시오.",
